23:T630,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I calculate my age on a particular date?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Enter your date of birth and set the “As of” field to that date. The tool shows the completed years, months and days between them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How are leap-year birthdays handled?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The calculation follows the real calendar, including 29 February, so the result matches how most official systems count completed years."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which date of birth should I use for official forms?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Use the date printed on your Class 10 certificate or birth certificate, which is the proof most departments accept."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does this tool apply age relaxation for categories?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Relaxation is defined in each notification. Calculate your age first, then apply the relaxation as stated in the official document."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Age Calculator free on ContentVerse India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. All India utility tools on ContentVerse India are free to use with no sign-up required."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this an official government website?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. ContentVerse India is an independent platform. We use public datasets and open APIs. For official records, use government portals like Parivahan, GST, FoSCoS, or ECI."}}]}24:T803,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"How to use Age Calculator","description":"Many forms in India ask for your exact age: school and college admissions, government job applications, insurance, pension schemes and passport or visa paperwork. This age calculator works out your age in years, months and days from your date of birth to today or to any date you choose, and shows ho","url":"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/age-calculator","totalTime":"PT5M","tool":{"@type":"HowToTool","name":"Age Calculator"},"step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"How to use the age calculator","text":"Enter your date of birth, then leave the “As of” date on today or change it to the cut-off date from the notification you are reading. The result shows the completed years, months and days between the two dates."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"How the calculation works","text":"The calculator subtracts the birth date from the reference date field by field. It counts completed years first, then the remaining months, then the remaining days, borrowing from the previous month when needed, using the real number of days in that month. Leap years, including 29 February birthdays, are handled by the calendar."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Where age cut-offs matter in India","text":"Competitive exams and public-sector recruitment fix a minimum and maximum age and often give relaxations for reserved categories, ex-servicemen or persons with disabilities. School admissions use a cut-off date such as 31 March for a given class. Insurance and pension products use age at the nearest or last birthday, which can change the premium."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Age in other ways","text":"Besides completed age, people sometimes ask for age in months for infants, in days for medical records or the number of days until a birthday. The year, month and day result lets you read any of these quickly. For legal purposes the age shown on official documents is always the one that counts."}]}19:[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"Age Calculator\",\"alternateName\":\"Age Calculator — Exact Years Months Days\",\"description\":\"Calculate exact age from date of birth in years, months, and days. Useful for forms, exams, and eligibility checks in India.\",\"url\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/age-calculator\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilitiesApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Any\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\"},\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"ContentVerse India\",\"url\":\"https://contentverse.co.in\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-IN\",\"featureList\":\"How to use the age calculator, How the calculation works, Where age cut-offs matter in India, Age in other ways\"}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$23"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"India Tools\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Age Calculator\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/age-calculator\"}]}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$24"}}]],"$L25"]
