2a:["$","p","Changing the “As of” date is the most useful fea",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Changing the “As of” date is the most useful feature. Government recruitment notices usually state a reference date, for example “age as on 1 August of the year”. Enter that date to see whether you meet the minimum or maximum age on the day that counts."}]
